From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ran Wang <wangra@google.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:46:39 -0400
Subject: D3D11: Clip readPixels area to render target subresource bounds

Clip D3D11 framebuffer readback regions against the source
RenderTarget11 subresource dimensions in both PBO and non-PBO paths to
prevent out-of-bounds staging texture copies and uninitialized memory
reads.

Test:
    angle_end2end_tests --gtest_filter="*TexStorage2DNPOTClampedBaseLevelPBOReadPixels*"
Bug: b/574967987
Change-Id: I727b71f24f77c97bcfc9eea406ff708d89662973
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8632217
Reviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Ran Wang <wangra@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Yuxin Hu <yuxinhu@google.com>

